Wait a minute! That `margin-block-end` and `margin-inline-end` are key here. I need to understand why `.card__comments` has *those specific* margins. To understand the logic of this, I need to check the CSS for all the `.cards` and understand the structure to understand how all the card items are positioned within the columns. This is where I'll get to the bottom of the layout behavior!

